      <li><strong>UCR / UCF Undercounter (UCR27 single-door 27-inch, UCR48 48-inch single section two-drawer or two-door, plus UCF freezer variants).</strong> Common in food trucks, small kitchens, mid-tier restaurants, back-bar. Coastal salt and tight installation airflow are the limiting factors.</li>
      <li><strong>MR / MMR / MMF Glass-Door Merchandisers (MR23 23-inch single-door, MR45 45-inch double-door, MMR45 and larger MMR variants plus MMF freezer variants).</strong> Display refrigeration. Anti-condensation heater wire failures at year 5 to 8 are the common merchandiser service item.</li>
